Revision history for CryptoKit

0.03    2026-10-23
        - Add CryptoKit::HolopeinenID for self-verifying, time-ordered,
          shard-safe identifiers
        - Add CryptoKit::FileVault for split-and-pack file encryption
        - Add CryptoKit::HMAC for HMAC signing
        - Add CryptoKit::TOTP for time-based one-time passwords
        - Add CryptoKit::FileEncrypt for streaming AES-GCM file encryption
        - Expand CLI with hmac, totp, encrypt-file, decrypt-file,
          vault-pack, vault-unpack, hid-issue, hid-verify
        - Fix FileVault CORE::pack/unpack ambiguity warnings
        - Fix HolopeinenID separator (. instead of _) to avoid
          base64url collision
        - 14 test files, 80+ subtests

0.02    2026-10-22
        - Add XS-accelerated HiatalaMrk is not part of this distribution.
          This version exists to mark the state before the large module
          additions above.

0.01    2026-10-22
        - Initial release with Hash, Password, Key, Encrypt, Secure
        - Basic CLI with genpw, hash, keygen
